    <data name="TT_Lapras_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The sea is calm today.[pause=20] Heading back, or staying a while longer?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Lapras_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Return to Metano?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Kecleon_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Welcome to the market![pause=15] Everything you need to set out again,[pause=10] and nothing that breaks on the way.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_KecleonP_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>My brother sells the essentials.[pause=20] I sell what you only find once.[pause=15] Take your time.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Chimecho_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Oh, new faces![pause=20] We see plenty of teams here...[pause=15] but rarely ones from as far as you.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Duskull_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Your belongings are safe.[pause=20] I never sleep,[pause=10] and I never lose a thing.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Marowak_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>You look like you've walked a long way.[pause=20] The training ground is open,[pause=10] if your legs still hold.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Croagunk_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Heh heh...[pause=15] Got something to trade?[pause=20] I've always got something to offer back.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Bidoof_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Yup![pause=15] Finest town on the coast, by golly.[pause=20] Well,[pause=10] it's the only one I know.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TT_Wigglytuff_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Friiiends![pause=25] You've come from the mainland, haven't you?[pause=20] The sea brought you here...[pause=15] So you're home.</value>
  </data>
